+  of benign tool outputs, enough to stop 69.1% and 59.8% of tasks. Strip markup before scanning (PIGuard''s
+  false positives on README chunks fell from 24.6% to 5.6%). 6. Assume an adaptive attacker gets through
+  these layers, and contain the consequences with controls that do not depend on recognizing the injection
+  (6.c.i, 6.c.ii, 10.a.i, 10.b.i). In one study, a search attack of up to 800 queries reached 99% attack
