+  to 15,980 thinking tokens), majority-voted parallel traces beat one long trace at the same budget (+10.1%),
+  and stopping once a candidate answer appears cut reasoning tokens by 24.5% for a 2.9-point accuracy
+  drop. Include ''none'' in the sweep but count its calls: GPT-5.6-luna made 21.5 calls at none against
+  5.4 at low and cost 4.58 times as much. 3. Where the site has an external correctness check (tests,
