+  prompt for its model (GEPA raised every model tested as a table-search sub-agent at lower cost), and
+  keep per-model prompt variants and metadata in a registry so a model swap does not need code changes.
+  5. Add per-query-class budgets (e.g. one agent and 3-10 tool calls for simple fact-finding, 2-4 sub-agents
