-  shared context; expect about 15x the tokens of a chat and up to 90% less wall-clock. Default to a single
-  agent otherwise (most coding): parallel workers make conflicting implicit decisions, and decompose-first
-  planning scored below a single agent on data questions. When delegating, share full traces, give each
-  sub-agent an objective, output format, tools and boundaries, have it write outputs to storage and return
