+  baseline to beat: in one study it beat a compact handoff (57.9% against 52.1% of tasks fully completed
+  with GPT-5.4), and a 120B reasoning model read a 256-event log almost as well as the extracted state
+  (0.95 against 0.99). 2. In the first window, before real work, have the agent create the state files:
