+  the same approver without the report) and rolled blocked commands back (see 4.b.i). Make a high-risk
+  flag block by default and require an explicit override: with an LLM monitor alerting at the permission
+  prompt, developers kept an agent''s covert exfiltration in 9 of 16 correctly alerted sessions. 6. Write
+  the policy as code with tested examples (rules carrying inline match and not-match cases validated at
+  parse time), keep it under version control, and expose hooks that can deny or rewrite a call before
+  it runs, so every decision is auditable apart from the agent loop. Check that the settings in effect
