   items (for example 20 resumes or abstracts in one context), plant an outlier late in the batch (position
   15 of 20), run every item alone in a fresh context as the reference, and log accuracy and decisions
-  by position, repeated actions and repeats of failed calls. 2. Find where uniformity enters: tool results
