+  varied and labeled history (and against per-item contexts): accuracy and outlier detection by position,
+  decision flip rate against the single-item runs and between two random batch arrangements next to a
+  renamed-keys baseline, exact-repeat rate, strategy switches after a planted run of unproductive steps
+  against a neutral history of the same length, task success, output-format errors, tokens and cache hit
   rate, over several template sets and per model, reporting the spread rather than one number.'
